# Tier 1 protected paths — Claude must confirm with user before writing.
# One glob pattern per line. Lines starting with # are comments.
# Patterns starting with ! are exceptions (allow-list overrides).
# Patterns expand ~ to the user home directory.
#
# This file is itself protected (see hooks/* below) — edit manually or with
# explicit user confirmation. Do not let a Claude session unilaterally rewrite.

# Always-loaded universal config
__CLAUDE_DIR__/AGENTS.md
__CLAUDE_DIR__/CLAUDE.md
__CLAUDE_DIR__/rules/*.md

# Knowledge layer foundation (wiki SCHEMA — the rules of the wiki itself)
__CLAUDE_DIR__/knowledge/SCHEMA.md

# Auto-memory (everything in here shapes Claude's identity model of the user)
__MEMDIR__/MEMORY.md
__MEMDIR__/*.md


# Hook system itself — recursion protection. Don't let a session disable enforcement.
__CLAUDE_DIR__/hooks/*
__CLAUDE_DIR__/settings.json
__CLAUDE_DIR__/settings.local.json
__CLAUDE_DIR__/engine.conf
